<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Abucus lifts interim shr, no dividend.</title>
<headline>Abucus lifts interim shr, no dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996 vs proforma six months to Dec 31, 1995</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	6.9	 vs     3.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   2.24	 vs     1.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.45	 vs     1.62</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.21	 vs     0.57</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.12	 vs     0.35</p>
<p>    Turnover		 15.68	 vs     6.75</p>
<p>Full name: Abacus Technology holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The said it was its policy to declare a dividend at the end of the financial year. It said it was confident of meeting its pre-listing forecast earnings for the full year if there was no significant deterioration of the economy.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
